WEBVTT

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:31.655
na edini možen način,

00:06:31.655 --> 00:06:33.844
in to je, da sklonite glavo in počnete

00:06:33.844 --> 00:06:35.666
marljivo in predano,

00:06:35.666 --> 00:06:37.352
s spoštovanjem in čaščenjem,

00:06:37.352 --> 00:06:39.396
katero koli stvar že ljubezen

00:06:39.396 --> 00:06:41.476
naslednjo prikliče.

00:06:41.476 --> 00:06:43.660
Preprosto storite to in to počnite

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:45.189
še in še in še

00:06:45.189 --> 00:06:47.965
in absolutno vam lahko obljubim
iz dolgih osebnih izkušenj

00:06:47.965 --> 00:06:50.220
v vseh smereh, zagotavljam vam,

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:52.290
da bo vse v redu.

00:06:52.290 --> 00:06:53.981
Hvala.

00:06:53.981 --> 00:06:57.981
(aplavz)